{"a":[11,13],"h":"<p>11.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"125\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 125.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 42.0 42.0 46.6 63.0 63.0 79.6 87.0 93.7 100.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"30.0 79.6 93.7 100.6 108.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onun ya'ni Musanın hemşiresine<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"67\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 67.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.0 30.0 30.0 44.3 44.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"51.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> kardeşinin izini ta'kıb et - ne olduğundan bir haber al - demişti.</p><p>Türkcemizde müzekker ve müennas zamiri ayrılmadığından türkcede «hemşiresine» denilince validesinin hemşiresine denilmiş gibi anlaşılıyor. Halbuki «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"51\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 51.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 18.0 18.0 24.7 36.7 36.7 41.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 24.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » değil «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"43\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 43.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 9.7 16.4 28.4 28.4 33.0\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » dir. Şu halde zâhir olan «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"48\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 48.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 18.0 18.0 24.7 24.7 31.4 31.4 38.3 38.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » kendi kızına denilmek iken onun hemşiresine denilmesi şefakate tansıs noktai nazarından daha beliğ olmuştur. Ya'ni kendi kızı olduğu için değil Musanın hemşiresi olduğu için ta'kıbini emretmişti<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"180\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 179.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 33.0 33.0 39.7 39.7 60.7 60.7 71.2 89.2 89.2 96.0 96.0 111.7 111.7 128.2 135.7 135.7 150.0 156.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"71.2 128.2 150.0 156.7 163.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o da onu uzaktan gözledi gördü<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"59\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 59.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 34.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.4 42.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onlar - ya'ni Âli Firvan<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"97\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 96.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.8 42.8 49.6 49.6 61.6 68.3\" y=\"26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 61.6 72.8 80.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> farkında değillerdi - gözettiğinin yâhud hemşiresi olduğunun farkına varmıyorlardı. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"442\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 442.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 19.6 19.6 27.0 27.0 36.0 47.3 64.6 71.3 71.3 71.3 80.3 80.3 87.0 87.0 96.0 113.3 120.0 120.0 129.0 129.0 141.0 141.0 162.0 162.0 168.7 175.6 182.3 182.3 189.0 195.7 195.7 211.6 225.0 225.0 225.0 233.3 240.0 251.3 258.0 266.3 275.3 275.3 282.0 282.0 291.0 291.0 302.3 318.0 327.0 333.7 349.6 356.3 356.3 365.3 372.7 390.0 403.6 414.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 36.0 47.3 96.0 175.6 189.0 233.3 240.0 258.0 282.0 302.3 318.0 327.0 333.7 356.3 365.3 372.7 426.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg></p>"}